      "text": "Developing ideas"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 3000,
      "end_ms": 4280,
      "text": "Activity 1"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 5500,
      "end_ms": 10480,
      "text": "Listen to the radio programme. What is it about?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 13000,
      "end_ms": 15120,
      "text": "Welcome to Animal Stars."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 16000,
      "end_ms": 20740,
      "text": "Today's Animal Star is a special dog, Bingjie."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 22000,
      "end_ms": 25740,
      "text": "He was a rescue dog and worked with firemen."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 25740,
      "end_ms": 35720,
      "text": "Bingjie had a good sense of smell. He worked after many earthquakes and helped find missing"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 35720,
      "end_ms": 45340,
      "text": "people. Over the years he saved many lives. His most famous rescue took place after the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 45340,
      "end_ms": 51680,
      "text": "2008 when Chuan earthquake. He helped to find 13 people."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 52900,
      "end_ms": 62440,
      "text": "Binhjia died on 2 October 2021 at the age of 14. He was a hero."
    }
  ],
